'''68-Artifice''' is a [[Moons|moon]] in ''[[Lethal Company]],'' with a difficulty rating of Hard and a hazard rating of "S++". The surface of Artifice is barren, aside from a large fence with four warehouses inside, leading up to the main entrance of the facility. Artifice features a very simple [[Fire Exit|fire exit]] found to the right of the main entrance. This moon's location is initially hidden from [[Employee|employees]], as it is not listed on the [[terminal]]. Its location must be deciphered first by travelling to [[Adamance]] and unlocking the [[cottage]] found in the valley.

Artifice is by far the hardest and most difficult moon in the game, with very high [[scrap]] yields in addition to having high power levels across the board and many hazards, results in an extremely dangerous environment.

