==Environment==
[[File:Artifice.png|thumb|A warehouse on Artifice.]]
Artifice is a strangely empty and eerie moon. Everything around looks decayed and abandoned. Employees will descend upon a fenced in complex with four garages being dominating within the outer fence. Each garage is different than the last, having different interior aspects. From [[The Ship|the ship]] and facing the facility, the garages are in this order:

*Warehouse Garage - (first, left)
*Hospital Garage - (first, right)
*Foggy Garage - ''Has heavy fog inside'' - (second, left)
* Inaccessible Garage - ''Back door is blocked and bay door is shut with no way inside'' - (second, right)

The closest warehouse appears to be a hospital with an office. Both of these rooms make great hiding spots.

Within this complex is a small shack that has lights and a wall switch. There is also a hole in the wall and fence that allows traversal outside of the fence line.

==Weather==
Artifice supports five [[weather]] types; Rainy, Foggy, Flooded, Stormy and Eclipsed.

===Rainy===
Tread the ground with caution while it is rainy, as the terrain on the surface of Artifice is already a deep brown, making quicksand difficult to identify.

=== Foggy ===
As the route between the ship and the facility is relatively straight forward on Artifice, employees shouldn't have too much trouble with getting lost here.

===Flooded===
It is ill-advised to purchase any items while this moon is flooded, as the [[Dropship]] will be completely submerged by [[water]] right at the start of the day.[[File:Artifice Flooded Timelapse.gif|none|thumb|480x480px|Time-lapse of flooding on Artifice.<ref name=":02" />]]
=== Stormy===
The distance from the ship to the facility can make transferring conductive items more dangerous.
===Eclipsed===
Artifice will spawn three indoor and outdoor entities at the beginning of the day while eclipsed. [[Old Bird|Old Birds]] will be a major threat for the entire duration of the day.

