==Strategy==
The current standard strategy for Artifice involves the Company Cruiser and [[Weed Killer|Weed killer]]. If the moon is eclipsed, perform the eclipsed jump<ref>https://youtu.be/LsX4OrnNZLY?si=hj4PStUMyXAbpQuR&t=985</ref> to reach the fire exit. Ideally, all employees should be able to perform the Artifice jump<ref>https://youtu.be/LsX4OrnNZLY?si=F3SokEwvQKXtisxz&t=952</ref> back to the ship.

There is an alternative, more casual strategy revolving around the Company Cruiser. Have three employees enter the facility via [[inverse teleporter]]. When the Cruiser is attached to the ship the driver will take up the role of [[Guide:Camera duty|camera duty]], teleporting employees in danger.

==Notes==
*Catwalks can be found connecting some of the warehouse which can be used to avoid the Old Birds.
*This moon is not found on the terminal's moon list but rather on a wall inside of the [[cottage]] on [[Adamance]], which requires a [[key]] to go inside.

